From 8d0e6a34dd51dcad3999b904822cb391ec05731a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ry <ry@Mac.eau.wi.charter.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:44:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Nebulos: convert :app to a library for composite embedding
 (RECONSTRUCTED)

Reconstruction of a lost local fork; base = SSimco/Cemu android-port 8759323e.
- :app application -> library (AGP 9.2.1, Kotlin 2.4.0), BuildConfig APPLICATION_ID/VERSION_NAME=embedded, no signing/minify
- manifest: application-level attributes dropped (host owns them)
- hooks (guessed from consumer + old APK): CemuApplication.mlcPathOverride / initializeForEmbedding(Application),
  NativeActiveSettings.setMLCPath (JNI + LaunchSettings::SetMLCPath)
- vcpkg libusb overlay for Android-from-macOS (libtool drops --target)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
